ー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これは乃木どこでもご紹介あった通り\nデビュー曲ぐるぐるカーテンの\n「開いた窓」の歌詞を「未来卵」と三年間歌い続けてたって言うのもありましたね‥\nそれ以来ファンの方は聞くとこによると\nそれにしか聞こえないらしいです(´｡･Q･｡`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではまいりましょう！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆が本当の歌詞！が間違えてた歌詞orそう聞こえる歌詞"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生まれたままでのサビ\n☆「いくつの嘘」\n！「いくつもーの」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレッタサビ\n☆「目をそらしたのは僕だー」\n！｢目をそらしたのは僕らー」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度目の青空か\n☆「なんだって出来る可能性」\n！「なんだーかできる可能性」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人はなぜ走るのか\nAメロ\n☆「だだっぴろい」\n！「ただ広い」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆「ノース サウス ウェスト イースト」\n！「のーサスペンス きす」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のfree＆easy\nサビの\n☆｢さあストレートに｣\n！｢さあストレートティー｣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"などなど...\n今日はここまで"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2015/08/09/2473880/0016.gif","alt":""},{"t